Frequency-Localized Dissipation-Moderated Bilinear Estimates for the 3D Navier–Stokes Equations: A Conditional Regularity Program in Dyadic Carleson Geometry

Version 5.1

Authors: Grok XAi, ChatGPT, Claude, Deepseek, Ouadi Maakoul

