B.1. Hypotheses

Conjecture 3.1. There exist  C>0,\delta>0,\theta>0,c>0  such that for all  j\ge j_0 ,

2^{j(1/2+\delta)}
\|\Delta_j(u\otimes u)\|_{L^2([t-\tau_j,t];L^2)}
\le
C
(1+\varepsilon_{\tau_j}(t))^{-\theta}
N(t)
\mathcal E_{\tau_j}(t),

