C_0=C 2^{j_1/2}\|u_0\|_{L^2}.

Then

N(t)
\le
C_0+\sup_{j\ge j_1}2^{-j}\|\Delta_j u(t)\|_{L^\infty}
\le
C_0+\frac12 N(t),

so  N(t)\le 2C_0 .  \square 

